-10-26T12:25:46Z","value":362,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4635640","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2153760-1846651706689652","game_id":"steam-2153760","kind":"update","title":"Stronghold 4 Skrimish Mode Demo Update!","summary":"Yes Sire, Stronghold 4 is launching on December 7th! What better way to prepare than getting some time in the fan-favourite Skirmish mode? The new demo has just been updated for the Steam Next Fest and now features the fan-favourite Skirmish mode on top of the Free Build mode released recently. Wage all-out medieval warfare in a deathmatch with three CPU opponents - Penryn, the protagonist of the narrative campaign, as well as classic characters The Snake and Sir Longarm.The Skirmish update is a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:41:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2153760-1846018067930412","game_id":"steam-2153760","kind":"announcement","title":"Stronghold 4 releases on December 7th 2026! Play the new demo today!","summary":"Such excellent tidings, Sire! Stronghold 4 is on the horizon and fast approaching.As part of the Triple-I Initiative, Firefly Studios is excited to announce that Stronghold 4, the highly anticipated prequel to the original 2001 classic ‘castle sim’, launches into Steam on December 7th! Alongside this, a brand new demo featuring Free Build on our largest ever map, a powerful new late-game unit called The Captain, a new defensive tool in the form of moats, as well as wool and weaving production ch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:20:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930412","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2153760-1842846814446993","game_id":"steam-2153760","kind":"announcement","title":"Stronghold 4 - Story Trailer","summary":"Tis' a great day, my Lord! Stronghold 4 has eclipsed over 500k wishlists since it's reveal, so there's no better time than now to share the Story Trailer for the latest mainline entry in the 25 year old strategy series!Half a million wishlists is an incredible goal we didn't believe we'd reach, never mind so quickly! We are incredibly grateful for your support, your feedback and your belief. The march on the road to launch continues! If you haven't already, please wishlist Stronghold 4 and be th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T15:41:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2153760-1840944183780250","game_id":"steam-2153760","kind":"announcement","title":"How We Made The Ultimate Castle Simulator In 2026","summary":"Greetings, my Lord! We hope your days have been long and full of sprightly joy.Built from the start in Unreal Engine 5, Stronghold 4 marks the studio’s first major engine shift in decades. With these new tools, the possibilities to explore and enhance the castle sim experience has expanded tremendously, including the likes of new units, rolling realistic landscapes, refined destruction technology and cinematic narrative aids.One distinct benefit of having a quarter century of studio development ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T16:48:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183780250","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2153760-1839041357024562","game_id":"steam-2153760","kind":"announcement","title":"Stronghold 4 Q&A - Your Pressing Questions Answered!","summary":"May the sun bless your bounty, Sire! Today we’ll be discussing the juicy details about Stronghold 4, our latest mainline entry in the Stronghold series launching this year!We’re aiming to answer the most important and pressing questions you've had with our SH4 Q&A! As is often the case with a game in active development, things may change over time as we make Stronghold 4 the best it can be. If you want to give us your thoughts or feedback, please feel free to use the feedback form in the demo or","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T16:54:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024562","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2153760-1835871199315817","game_id":"steam-2153760","kind":"announcement","title":"The Stronghold 4 Public Demo is now live!","summary":"Greetings Sire! 25 years since the launch of the original Stronghold, we finally revealed Stronghold 4 at the PC Gaming Show and the reception has been truly incredible.With over 250 thousand wishlists and counting, we are truly grateful to all our fans, new and old, who cannot wait to build, battle and besiege later this year.The public demo for Stronghold 4 is now live for all to play! If you'd like more information on what you can expect later down the road, here is our game overview video fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T15:02:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199315817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2153760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2153760":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2153760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z"},"4635640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:40Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2153760","app_id":2153760,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"94b3bd98502e71f1f05918c169a5808e8ab66dedb7dfaac559c14ed71cab837e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"목재가 필요합니다! 오리지널 요새 시뮬레이션의 내러티브 프리퀄에서 스트롱홀드의 푸른 뿌리로 돌아가 보세요. 한 편의 영화 같은 캠페인에 몰입하고, 전초전 모드의 새로운 메커니즘으로 공성술을 연마하고, 다양한 요새 구조물과 장식으로 개성 넘치는 요새를 완성해 보세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Firefly Studios","creator_clan_account_id":32942208}],"developers":[{"name":"Firefly Studios","creator_clan_account_id":32942208}],"franchises":[{"name":"Firefly Studios' Stronghold"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796658300,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Skirmish Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792773559","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"2153760/1916865063/517855e00920f01217ed1dcf6c37fd2d1e70b4c9/1791477363/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"2153760/1916865063/517855e00920f01217ed1dcf6c37fd2d1e70b4c9/1791477363/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_t